    (descr "INMP441ACEZ I2S MEMS microphone, LGA_CAV 4.72x3.76x1.00mm, bottom port. Land pattern 1:1 per DS-INMP441-00 rev 1.1 Figures 14/16: pins 1-4/6-9 lands 0.60x0.40mm, pitch 1.05 BSC, rows 2.66 BSC; pin 5 = annular GND ring OD 1.56 / ID 0.96 modelled as PTH pad with 0.90mm drill = PCB sound hole (datasheet recommends 0.5-1.0mm hole). Pin positions derived from Figure 16 BOTTOM VIEW mirrored to top view; pin 1 anchored by the Figure 16 TOP VIEW pin-1 dot (top-right corner, REFERENCE CORNER). Pin map (top view): 1 SCK, 2 SD, 3 WS, 4 L/R on the -Y row (x +1.86..-1.29); 9 GND, 8 CHIPEN, 7 VDD, 6 GND on the +Y row; 5 GND ring at (-1.29, 0). VERIFY pin-1 orientation against the physical part before production.")
